{
  "_comment": "W5.4 RPG demo. Player (hp/xp/level/hp_max) attacks via 'spark' (space) → spawns short-lived weapon_swing at player position. Swing damages enemies on contact. Enemy death emits killed signal → player gains xp → xp ≥ threshold emits level_up → state_mul hp_max + heal to full.",

